01:30.567 --> 01:35.587
Naruto vs. Mecha Naruto

01:44.727 --> 01:46.437
Wait...!

02:05.607 --> 02:06.607
Man Beast Clone!

02:09.607 --> 02:11.057
Expansion Jutsu!

02:11.857 --> 02:13.937
Human Boulder!

02:18.977 --> 02:21.227
I won't let you get away!

02:35.307 --> 02:39.817
<b>"TEAM 10 CHOJI AKIMICHI SWIMMING UP A WATERFALL"</b>

02:42.397 --> 02:44.807
How dare you hurt Choji!

02:45.107 --> 02:47.517
Inuzuka Style!
Man-Beast Transformation Combo!

02:48.187 --> 02:49.517
Two-Headed Wolf!

02:51.687 --> 02:52.687
Wolf Fang Over Fang!

03:02.707 --> 03:06.717
<b>"TEAM 8 KIBA INUZUKA SUFFERS A BLOW TO HIS EGO"</b>

03:07.227 --> 03:08.977
Choji! Kiba!

03:09.397 --> 03:11.397
Wait... Then who's in front right now?

03:11.807 --> 03:13.517
No one's there!

03:15.477 --> 03:17.057
Hold on!

03:28.687 --> 03:29.647
Are you okay?!

03:31.147 --> 03:32.517
Nine Tails' chakra is leaking!

03:33.647 --> 03:36.937
I was trying so hard not to throw up,
so I used Nine Tails' chakra...

03:38.517 --> 03:40.187
And what were you doing?!

03:40.937 --> 03:41.857
Sorry!

03:42.857 --> 03:43.897
He's coming, Neji!

03:45.647 --> 03:48.187
<i>I was not chosen merely</i>
<i> to search out the enemy...</i>

03:48.687 --> 03:50.767
<i>but because I have</i>
<i>this absolute defense!</i>

03:51.647 --> 03:52.977
Rotation!

04:15.767 --> 04:18.307
Good! If he stays inside
your rotation,

04:18.397 --> 04:20.557
the Nine Tails' chakra
can't be sucked out!

04:23.557 --> 04:24.667
<i>On your mark!</i>

04:25.517 --> 04:27.087
<i>Get set!</i>

04:31.227 --> 04:32.437
What is going on?

04:38.727 --> 04:40.147
What speed!

04:44.147 --> 04:45.187
Wha—?!

04:49.897 --> 04:52.607
The Mecha Naruto overtook
the rotation?!

05:05.307 --> 05:06.557
Kakashi Sensei!

05:12.607 --> 05:14.517
It's so beautiful...

05:16.307 --> 05:20.307
<b>"TEAM 3 NEJI HYUGA WITHDRAWN"</b>

05:23.307 --> 05:26.817
<b>"TEAM 7 ACTING TEAM LEADER CAPTAIN YAMATO"</b>

05:26.817 --> 05:29.317
<b>"ATMOSPHERIC BREAKTHROUGH"</b>

05:29.767 --> 05:32.767
Let me fight too, Kakashi Sensei!

05:33.187 --> 05:35.937
If we team up,
we can take him down!

05:36.017 --> 05:36.687
No!

05:37.107 --> 05:40.057
It's not just your problem
if the Nine Tails is captured.

05:40.147 --> 05:42.057
The very existence of
the village is at stake!

05:43.557 --> 05:44.687
Naruto!

05:45.147 --> 05:47.477
My existence is at stake too!

05:47.607 --> 05:48.647
Hey!

05:52.227 --> 05:53.517
Kakashi Sensei!

05:54.557 --> 05:55.897
Sit still for a while!

05:57.227 --> 06:00.517
I'll show you the true essence
of the Copy Ninja.

06:06.057 --> 06:07.147
Can't do it...

06:07.227 --> 06:10.107
That might be... impossible.

06:10.187 --> 06:13.687
<i>Idiot... idiot...</i>
<i>Are you an idiot?</i>

06:16.517 --> 06:18.647
Damn it!

06:18.617 --> 06:21.617
<b>"TEAM 7 TEAM LEADER KAKASHI HATAKE"</b>

06:21.617 --> 06:23.617
<b>"NOTHING GOOD ABOUT HIM"</b>

06:24.437 --> 06:25.557
Kakashi Sensei!

06:28.687 --> 06:31.517
Who the hell are... you?

06:31.607 --> 06:32.647
What are you?

06:33.397 --> 06:34.557
Nine Tails...

06:35.227 --> 06:36.267
You can talk?

06:36.517 --> 06:40.397
Give me... Nine Tails.

06:41.937 --> 06:43.477
Like hell I will!

06:44.557 --> 06:46.227
Nine Tails...

06:46.607 --> 06:49.187
I want it! Give it to me!

06:50.227 --> 06:51.107
Damn it!

06:51.187 --> 06:52.807
I don't have... any strength...

06:57.857 --> 07:02.307
I can't afford to die here!

07:07.807 --> 07:08.687
You?!

07:11.147 --> 07:12.857
An ally of the Leaf.

07:13.897 --> 07:15.477
I am Gaara of the Sand.

07:19.627 --> 07:20.417
Gaara!

07:20.877 --> 07:23.417
The Hokage should have relied
on me from the very start.

07:24.417 --> 07:26.547
Long-distance battles and
the ultimate defense...

07:26.627 --> 07:29.627
This is precisely
my kind of mission.

07:30.507 --> 07:32.547
And most of all,
machines are vulnerable to sand.

07:32.837 --> 07:36.457
Don't want... One Tails...
I want Nine Tails!

07:37.627 --> 07:40.087
One Tails is no longer inside me.

07:40.167 --> 07:43.377
However... I cannot let you
have Naruto's Nine Tails!

07:44.337 --> 07:46.507
As the Kazekage... and...

07:46.587 --> 07:48.457
as Naruto's friend!

07:48.757 --> 07:51.457
Gaara! You are so cool, you know!

07:52.257 --> 07:53.167
Sand—!

07:53.257 --> 07:54.507
Hey, if it isn't Mr Gaara!

07:55.207 --> 07:57.507
So you're here to pick up
the pieces

07:57.587 --> 07:59.667
after the Nine Tails
is captured? Hmm?

08:00.257 --> 08:03.207
What? The Nine Tails' chakra
hasn't been extracted yet?

08:04.417 --> 08:08.007
Weren't you supposed to be
the new hope for the Akatsuki?

08:08.167 --> 08:08.877
Huh?

08:09.127 --> 08:11.007
You're a member of Akatsuki?

08:11.087 --> 08:15.337
Nine Tails... Nine Tails.
I don't want One Tails...

08:18.297 --> 08:19.877
Did you hear that, Gaara!

08:19.957 --> 08:22.257
Even the Mecha doesn't want you.

08:22.417 --> 08:24.587
How sad... So sad...

08:26.507 --> 08:28.337
Is it any wonder you lost to me

08:28.417 --> 08:31.047
and got your Tailed Beast
taken away? Hmm?

08:31.207 --> 08:33.377
You're as weak as a baby...

08:33.457 --> 08:36.047
You really need some cheering up.
Yup, yup.

08:36.127 --> 08:40.377
Gaara... Gaara...
Cheer up and smile...

08:40.457 --> 08:42.087
Gaara... Gaara... Gaara.

08:41.087 --> 08:42.927
<b>"LOVE"</b>

08:43.347 --> 08:45.597
<b>"ANGER"</b>

08:44.547 --> 08:45.797
You're dead!

08:51.007 --> 08:52.507
Sand Prison!

08:52.707 --> 08:55.547
All you had to do was give
a little squeeze...

08:56.127 --> 08:58.337
A little squeeze was
all you had to do...

08:59.377 --> 09:00.457
A squeeze...

09:00.107 --> 09:04.117
<b>"THE KAZEKAGE GAARA DESERTED THE BATTLE"</b>

09:09.457 --> 09:11.507
I... I'm getting out of here!

09:19.587 --> 09:20.507
This is...?!

09:22.547 --> 09:25.007
The Akatsuki have some nerve!

09:25.547 --> 09:28.257
I'm the one who created this child...

09:28.337 --> 09:30.007
But they stole him.

09:30.087 --> 09:31.207
Orochimaru?

09:33.007 --> 09:34.917
Ninja Art: Snake Mouth Trap...

09:35.417 --> 09:37.797
I summoned the inside of
a giant snake's stomach.

09:37.877 --> 09:38.837
Where's Sasuke?

09:38.957 --> 09:40.377
I'm sorry...

09:40.457 --> 09:44.547
But I thought I'd settle this debt
all by myself.

09:45.087 --> 09:48.457
<i>He was with me earlier,</i>
<i>but he ditched me!</i>

09:48.457 --> 09:50.377
<i>It's so annoying!</i>

09:55.377 --> 09:59.297
But now, I have custody
of this child once more.

09:59.957 --> 10:02.707
Do as I say, okay?

10:03.257 --> 10:05.297
Now take the Nine Tails!

10:05.417 --> 10:07.667
If I'm able to possess Sasuke
and the Nine Tails,

10:07.757 --> 10:10.837
I will have nothing to fear
in this world!

10:12.667 --> 10:14.377
Aren't you forgetting one thing?

10:14.457 --> 10:16.957
One of the feared Legendary Sannin...

10:17.047 --> 10:18.417
... your dear friend?

10:18.417 --> 10:19.457
Pervy Sage!

10:19.757 --> 10:24.377
Is this a rip-off of
my Toad Mouth Trap, Orochimaru?

10:24.377 --> 10:25.457
Yes...

10:25.547 --> 10:28.547
And thanks to that,
Naruto cannot escape.

10:29.257 --> 10:32.377
