14:19.917 --> 14:21.627
For Sasuke's sake...

14:29.257 --> 14:30.457
The Nine Tails' chakra...

14:32.507 --> 14:34.707
Even if that power is exhausted...

14:35.207 --> 14:36.627
For Sasuke's sake...

14:36.707 --> 14:40.877
If you think of Sasuke as a friend,
no matter what...

14:42.047 --> 14:43.377
